# ANSI_COLOR xap xi mau "vermilion" #D64C3E (NaMiOS v3 "Dong Son", thay cho
# "do son" #C93643 cua v2 "Sen Viet" cu) bang bang mau ANSI 16-mau co ban
# (terminal thuong khong ho tro truecolor cho truong nay) — xem ma hex that
# tai usr/share/namios-branding/logo/brand.json (file do nhom khac so huu,
# se cap nhat rieng), khong bia mau chinh xac hon muc ANSI cho phep.
#
# Nen tang goc: Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie). NaMiOS la ban phan phoi lai
# theo giay phep cua Debian/KDE/cac goi FOSS di kem — KHONG phai ban Debian
# chinh thuc, KHONG duoc Software in the Public Interest (SPI)/Debian Project
# chung nhan hay phat hanh. Giu ID_LIKE=debian (truong KY THUAT, khong phai
# nhan hien thi) de cong cu/script kiem tra tuong thich apt/dpkg van hoat
# dong dung (nhieu tool doc ID_LIKE de phat hien he dua tren Debian).
# Xem docs/branding/TRADEMARK-LICENSE-COMPLIANCE.md cho can cu day du.
#
# File nay DUOC TAO lan dau 10/11/2026 (yeu cau Cuong: xoa nhan dien Debian
# khoi man hinh nguoi dung thay, bao gom os-release). Hook
# hooks/normal/0120-namios-branding.hook.chroot chi con chuc nang kiem tra
# LOGO= (idempotent, da co san trong file nay nen hook se khong doi gi them).
#
# verified_on_host: NO — chua xac nhan `hostnamectl`/kcm about-distro/
# neofetch hien dung PRETTY_NAME nay tren may that.
